@startuml

title IdeaHub AI - Initial TO-BE Transformation Opportunity Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #F5F8FB
 BorderColor #103B66
 FontColor #172A3A
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
 DiamondBorderColor #B97818
}

skinparam ArrowColor #637487
skinparam note {
 BackgroundColor #EEF6FB
 BorderColor #246A9F
}

|Business Stakeholder / Process Owner|

start

if (Existing business idea?) then (Yes)

 :Identify business problem\nor transformation idea;

 :Submit available process,\npain-point and outcome information;

else (No)

 |Process Mining / Process Analyst|

 :Analyse existing process;

 :Identify process signal;

 note right
 Examples:
 - Bottleneck
 - Rework
 - Waiting time
 - Exception
 - Manual hand-off
 - Process deviation
 end note

 :Submit Process Mining finding\nand supporting evidence;

endif

|IdeaHub AI|

:Interpret unstructured\nopportunity information;

:Structure initial opportunity;

note right
Identify:
- Process
- Stakeholder
- Problem
- Pain point
- Frequency / volume
- Expected outcome
- Supporting evidence
end note

|Transformation Analyst / CoE|

:Review AI interpretation;

if (Interpretation correct?) then (Yes)

else (No)

 :Correct interpretation;

endif

|IdeaHub AI|

:Identify missing or\nunclear information;

if (Material information missing?) then (Yes)

 :Generate contextual\nclarification questions;

 |Transformation Analyst / CoE|

 if (Analyst can answer?) then (Yes)

 :Provide clarification\nor supporting evidence;

 else (No)

 |Business Stakeholder / Process Owner|

 :Provide additional business\nor process information;

 |Transformation Analyst / CoE|

 :Review additional input;

 endif

 |IdeaHub AI|

 :Update opportunity information;

else (No)

endif

:Assess Business Value;

:Assess Feasibility;

:Identify Risk;

:Assess Evidence Strength;

:Compare intervention options;

note right
Possible interventions:

- No intervention
- Further assessment
- Process redesign
- Policy / procedure
- Business rules
- Workflow automation
- RPA
- Predictive ML
- Generative AI
- Agentic AI
- Hybrid
end note

:Generate recommended\nintervention;

:Generate rationale,\nassumptions and risks;

|Transformation Analyst / CoE|

:Review assessment\nand recommendation;

if (Analyst agrees?) then (Yes)

 :Submit recommendation;

else (No)

 :Modify assessment or\nintervention;

 :Record rationale;

endif

|Transformation Lead / Governance|

:Review opportunity,\nevidence and recommendation;

if (More information required?) then (Yes)

 :Request clarification;

 |Transformation Analyst / CoE|

 :Collect / update information;

 |IdeaHub AI|

 :Refresh assessment;

 |Transformation Lead / Governance|

 :Review updated recommendation;

else (No)

endif

if (Approve progression?) then (Yes)

 :Assign final outcome;

 note right
 Possible outcomes:
 - Explore
 - Prototype
 - Pilot
 - Candidate for Prioritisation
 end note

else (No)

 :Reject or Refine;

endif

:Record human decision\nand rationale;

|IdeaHub AI|

:Preserve decision traceability\nand reviewer feedback;

stop

@enduml
